[Submission1.Objectives]
Hold your defensive positions in the village.
[Submission1.Description]
Overwhelming enemy forces are advancing upon the positions of the 1st Battalion, 901st Panzergrenadier. With the aid of a detachment from the 12th SS Hitlerjugend Division, hold this area!

Your orders:
- In cooperation with the tanks from the 12th SS, hold your defenses around the village.
[Submission1.Success]
Well done Commander! The enemy hasn’t broken your fighting spirit!
[Submission1.Failed]
Mission failed! Your forces are defeated.
[Submission2.Objectives]
Repulse the enemy attacks.
[Submission2.Description]
We have just received reports that the enemy has redirected their attack and are now approaching from the North. Prepare your troops for this new onslaught commander.
 
Your orders:
- Repulse this new enemy attack.
[Submission2.Success]
Well done Commander! The enemy couldn’t break your defenses.
[Submission2.Failed]
Mission failed!
[StringTable.Change]
You have received additional armored units from the Division reserves.
